<Slide notes={`陈晨的例子把感知边界讲得最清楚。他路过公告栏，看到外观状态变了——贴了新通知的样子。这时候他能确认的只有一件事：这个对象的公开状态已经变化。

公告栏绑定了 Skill，通知正文属于内部字段，不会因为他站得近就自动进入感知。要想知道具体改了什么，必须发起一次真实的查询。

这个限制看起来是麻烦，其实是情节的基础：有人先知道、有人后知道，信息差才有意义。如果站得近就什么都知道，公告、对话这些渠道就全白设计了。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.5.1　感知返回有范围的事实</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>站得近，也未必知道改了什么</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 20, background: '#20344B' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>公告栏（对象 · 示意）</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 150, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>公开状态：外观已变</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>可被感知</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 150, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>通知正文：内部字段</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>不自动进入感知</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 568, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>陈晨看到公告栏的外观状态变了，只能确认“这个对象的公开状态已变化”。</Text>
                <Box style={{ background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>要知道具体改了什么，应发起真实查询</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>站得近不会让 Skill 对象的内部字段自动进入感知</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 84, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>公开状态变了</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>范围内即可观察</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 84, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>通知正文没进来</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>内部字段须经真实查询</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 84, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>信息差有了基础</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>有人先知道，有人后知道</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.5 感知、导航与动作</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>07 / 23</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
